"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4767330","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3897300-1846651706692284","game_id":"steam-3897300","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest","summary":"Far from earth, your only weapons are your work mechs, your only support your fellow miners. When tensions boil over, will you take a stand?We’re part of Steam Next Fest! It’s the perfect opportunity to play our demo if you haven’t already. Lovers of choice-heavy narrative games, mechs, or hand-drawn art, please gather round. We have a game we think you’ll like.And hey, if you liked the demo, give us a wishlist :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:00:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692284","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897300-1834602721201143","game_id":"steam-3897300","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo out now!","summary":"We’ve just released the A Line Held Tight demo on steam!⛏️ Get to know some of the characters, pilot your rig, get caught in a skirmish.🔧 And don’t forget to wishlist the game if you enjoy it!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T08:35:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721201143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897300-1834602721191070","game_id":"steam-3897300","kind":"announcement","title":"A Line Held Tight is in the Story-Rich showcase!","summary":"Exciting news everyone, we're part of the official selection for Fellow Traveller's Story-Rich showcase! There are soooo many cool games as part of this, you'd better check it out when it airs on June 6 at 10AM PT / 6pm BST. We've got a little something to share as part of the showcase too... catch it live or keep an eye on our socials afterwards. Watch the show on Fellow Traveller's Youtube or Twitch channel, and let us know in the chat what you think :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T14:50:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721191070","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897300-1832700592792438","game_id":"steam-3897300","kind":"announcement","title":"An Introduction to A Line Held Tight","summary":"Video version of this post above ^^^ Hi, I’m Cel Davison, from Humble Grove: a worker owned video games making co-operative.Recently we revealed A Line Held Tight. I wanted to talk about our approach to making it, what we’re doing and why. The visuals, the music and the writing: what’s it all in service of? A Line Held Tight is a dynamic sci-fi visual novel that follows The Canary, a member of a mining colony on a far-off planet. Out there, cut off from the rest of humanity by a vast expanse of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T16:01:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592792438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3897300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3897300":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3897300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:06Z"},"4767330":{"last_attempt_at":